"Gestures: swipe down to open, swipe up to close" = "手势：下滑打开，上滑关闭";
"GitHub Copilot reported no quota" = "GitHub Copilot 未报告任何额度";
"GitHub Copilot's login was refused. Sign in again in your editor" = "GitHub Copilot 的登录被拒绝。请在编辑器中重新登录";
"GitHub Copilot's usage response unreadable" = "GitHub Copilot 用量响应无法解析";
"GitHub's Copilot endpoint answered" = "GitHub 的 Copilot 接口响应异常";
"Global: they work from any app. The panel's own keys: Escape closes it, ⌘R refreshes, ⌘, opens Settings, ⌘Q quits." = "全局快捷键：在任何应用中都有效。面板自身的按键：Escape 关闭，⌘R 刷新，⌘, 打开设置，⌘Q 退出。";
