"Install and sign in to Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI or GitHub Copilot; its meters appear here." = "安装并登录 Claude Code、Codex、Cursor、Gemini CLI 或 GitHub Copilot，其仪表会显示在这里。";
