"Let Claude Code talk to the notch?" = "让 Claude Code 与刘海通信？";
"Let Claude Code tell the notch when it starts, stops or waits for you. The hook passes on the event name, the session id and the folder's name; the meter refreshes at once, the card counts sessions, and a badge shows while Claude waits for your input." = "让 Claude Code 在开始、停止或等待你时告知刘海。钩子只传递事件名、会话 ID 和文件夹名；仪表会立即刷新，卡片会统计会话数，Claude 等待你输入时会显示徽标。";
