"Off by default so the menu bar keeps its room; the Options menu is then a right-click on the rings. On, it puts Quit and Settings one click (and VoiceOver's VO-M-M) away, which a Mac without a notch needs." = "默认关闭，以免占用菜单栏空间；此时“选项”菜单通过右键点按圆环打开。打开后，“退出”和“设置”一键可达（VoiceOver 的 VO-M-M 亦可），没有刘海的 Mac 需要它。";
"Offline, retrying" = "离线，正在重试";
"Once per window and reset period: when its pace first reaches on track or behind, and again when it comes within an hour of running out. Each one says what to do about it. macOS asks for permission when this is turned on or the first alert is due, never at launch." = "每个窗口每个重置周期各一次：当节奏首次达到勉强够用或落后时，以及距离用完不足一小时时再提醒一次。每条通知都会说明该怎么做。macOS 会在打开此项或首次提醒到期时询问权限，不会在启动时询问。";
"One entry in ~/.claude/settings.json makes Claude Code run %@ --hook when a session starts, a turn ends or it waits for you: the meter refreshes at once, the card counts sessions, and a dot shows while Claude waits. The file is backed up first, and you can remove it any time from this section." = "在 ~/.claude/settings.json 中添加一项，即可让 Claude Code 在会话开始、一轮结束或等待你时运行 %@ --hook：仪表会立即刷新，卡片会统计会话数，Claude 等待时会显示圆点。文件会先备份，你随时可以在本节移除它。";
"Only turns longer than" = "仅限时长超过";
