"Set this as statusLine in %1$@, or use Install status line… to have it written for you. Claude Code runs %2$@ --statusline after every turn; it forwards the context fill, the rate limits and the session cost to the app and prints one line for Claude Code's own bar." = "把它设为 %1$@ 中的 statusLine，或使用“安装状态行…”自动写入。Claude Code 会在每轮结束后运行 %2$@ --statusline；它把上下文占用、限额和本会话花费转发给应用，并为 Claude Code 自己的状态栏输出一行。";
