"Synced Claude Code logs from another Mac, or any folder of transcripts: a projects folder or a flat folder of session folders both work. Claude Desktop's Cowork sessions are read automatically when present. The rate-limit meters are account-wide already; this only widens the cost card." = "从另一台 Mac 同步的 Claude Code 日志，或任何记录文件夹：projects 文件夹或会话文件夹的平铺目录均可。Claude Desktop 的 Cowork 会话存在时会自动读取。限额仪表本就以账户为单位；此项只扩展花费卡片。";
"Tells you what to do, not just how much." = "不仅告诉你用了多少，还告诉你该怎么做。";
"The login item points at a copy of the app that has moved. Turn it off and on again." = "登录项指向的应用副本已被移动。请关闭后再重新打开。";
"The rings shrink to a dot once no assistant has been active for 30 minutes and every window is quiet; a hook event, file activity, a pace change or resting the pointer on them brings them back." = "当 30 分钟内没有助手活动且所有窗口都很安静时，圆环会缩成一个圆点；钩子事件、文件活动、节奏变化或把指针停在上面都会让它们恢复。";
